{'symbol': 'MMM', 'date': '2022-03-02 07:30:00', 'title': '3M COMPLETES SALE OF ITS FLOOR PRODUCTS BUSINESS IN WESTERN EUROPE', 'text': 'ST. PAUL, MINN., MARCH 2, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- 3M (NYSE: MMM) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS COMPLETED THE SALE OF ITS FLOOR PRODUCTS BUSINESS IN WESTERN EUROPE, FORMERLY KNOWN AS DINAC, TO GERFLOR GROUP.'}